# About Site

This site is meant to be a simple site that's easy to update on
mobile so I can just add markdown files to the repo and it will
handle everything to do with updating the RSS feed and publishing etc.
Check out the repo on [Github here](https://github.com/dubitabley/travel-blog)

# Colophon

This website is built using [Zine](https://zine-ssg.io/) which is a
neat static site generator created with Zig. I think it's probably
more powerful than I need but it's better to be more flexible than less.
